<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Absensi Sekolah V3</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/face-api.js@0.22.2/dist/face-api.min.js"></script></head><body>
<div id="loginPage"><div class="login"><div class="brandmark">🏫</div><div class="eyebrow">SISTEM ABSENSI SEKOLAH • V3</div><h1 id="loginSchoolName">SD NEGERI KIUPUNU</h1><p>Absensi guru dan siswa berbasis web dengan kamera, absensi manual, rekap dan pengaturan sekolah.</p><div class="loginbox"><input id="username" placeholder="Username"><input id="password" type="password" placeholder="Password" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')doLogin()"><button class="primary" onclick="doLogin()">🔐 Masuk</button><small>Demo: admin/admin123 · piket/piket123 · guru/guru123</small></div></div></div>
<div id="app" class="hidden"><aside><div class="brand">🎒 <b>ABSENSI<br>KIUPUNU</b><span>V3</span></div><div id="profile" class="profile"></div><nav id="nav"></nav><div class="sidebottom">Dibuat oleh <b>Odi Funan</b><button onclick="logout()">↪ Keluar</button></div></aside><main><header><div><h2 id="title">Dashboard</h2><small id="clock"></small></div><div class="schoolpill" id="schoolPill">SD Negeri Kiupunu</div></header><section id="content"></section></main></div>
<div id="modal" class="modal hidden"><div class="modalcard"><button class="close" onclick="closeModal()">×</button><h2 id="modalTitle">📷 Kamera</h2><p id="modalHelp"></p><div class="camera"><video id="video" autoplay muted playsinline></video><div class="guide"></div></div><div id="camStatus" class="notice">Memuat...</div><button id="camAction" class="primary" onclick="cameraAction()">Mulai</button></div></div>
<script src="/app.js"></script></body></html>
